total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 问题现象\n在 macOS 上安装并打开 v2rayN.app 时，可能出现以下提示：\n```\n“v2rayN.app”已损坏，无法打开。您应该将它移到废纸篓。\n```\n这是由于 **macOS Gatekeeper** 安全机制 拦截了来自非 App Store 或未签名的第三方应用。\n\n## 解决方案\n* 打开终端\n\n  按下 Command + 空格 输入 Terminal 打开终端。\n\n* 临时允许任意来源应用（可选）\n```\nsudo spctl --master-disable\n```\n完成后，你可以在 系统偏好设置 → 安全性与隐私 → 通用 中看到“任何来源”选项。(需要先确保安全性上选择“任何来源”后再进行安装)\n安装完成后建议再执行：\n```\nsudo spctl --master-enable\n```\n* 去除隔离标记\n```\nsudo xattr -r -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/v2rayN.app\n```\n确保路径 /Applications/v2rayN.app 正确。\n* 打开 v2rayN\n回到 应用程序 文件夹，双击 v2rayN.app 即可正常打开。\n\n\n参考链接：\n[macOS 下 v2rayN 打不开的解决方法](https://juejin.cn/post/7546914478652604425)\n[v2ryN下载链接（github release站点，可以搜索“github在线加速”找个加速站下载）](https://github.com/2dust/v2rayN/releases)\n[v2rayN-macos-arm64.dmg](https://github.com/2dust/v2rayN/releases/download/7.22.7/v2rayN-macos-arm64.dmg)\n[v2rayN-windows-64.zip](https://github.com/2dust/v2rayN/releases/download/7.22.7/v2rayN-windows-64.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrows/mirrows.github.io/issues/47/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrows/mirrows.github.io/issues/47/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"img":"https://bing.com/th?id=OHR.GrandPlace_EN-US6561229456_1920x1080.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1080.jpg&pid=hp"},"comments":[]},"__N_SSG":true}